{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさいーっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの更新になってしまいましたが皆さん元気ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪とかひいてないですか(>_<)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは元気ですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと一日遅れちゃったけど、せいたんHappy Birthday"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はレッスン終わりに誕生日サプライズをしたよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも\"まいやんまいやん\"言って来るせいたんが可愛くてたまらんのです。//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなせいたんが大好きだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年にしてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、タイトルコール4位ありがとうございます(>_<)！！！\n最近まで知らなくて、絶対ランク外だと思ってたんですけどまさか4位を頂けるとは…本当に嬉しいです！（泣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも皆さんの期待に応えられるように頑張るので、応援よろしくお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとそれと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月11日の東京モーターショーに乃木坂46が参加します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベントや握手会などあるので、時間がある方は是非とも足を運んで下さい(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとそれとそれと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の番組は見てくれましたか？\n来週も盛り沢山な内容になってるので楽しみにしていて下さい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週のまいやんどうなっちゃうの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う〜ん、さて…来週までのお楽しみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！\n答えられる範囲でたまってる質問に答えていきます(^_-)-☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽よく聞く洋楽は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はレッチリ(Red Hot Chili Peppers)とか、ALICIA KEYS、Justin Bieber、Ne-Yo、Madonnaとかはまってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽好きな洋服のお店は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ROJITA、INGNIとかでよくお買い物します(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってる洋服はワンピースが多いかな♪？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽好きなブランドは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだろ…サマンサタバサ？\nお財布もカード入れもサマンサです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽構ってほしがり屋ですか？それとも構いたがりですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"FLASHにも書いてあったけど、(こう見えて)寂しがり屋なので構ってほしがり屋です。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買い物とかは一人で行けるけど、それ以外は一人にしないでー！泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽漫画やアニメは好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画全然読まないしアニメも全く見ないんです…（泣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画より小説派！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クレヨンしんちゃんとかはよく見てたけどね(*^^*)笑\n一つだけ好きなアニメ教えてって言われたら…けいおん！ですかね←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何気に家にDVD全部あります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽夏女？冬女？それとも春・秋？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対冬女！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼稚園の入学式、卒園式、小学生の入学式、中学校の入学式、高校の入学式、どれも雪が降ってました…悲しい(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▽肌の白さの秘訣は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秘訣…とくに何もしてないんですよ(;_;)\n焼けにくい体質なのか、真夏に外に出でも赤くなってまた元の白さに戻って…\n日焼け止めもあまり塗らないし…"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/bearing.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、洗顔したあとはすぐに化粧水つけて保湿してます！\n洗顔してすぐが大事！乾燥すると良くないからね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこのへんで終わりにしようかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続きはまた今度ね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん七変化。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/06/dvc00492.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19歳…まだ……大丈夫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日も一日頑張りましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもたくさんのコメントありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}